# Scenario "basement-movie" (US, milestones 6 and 9, issue 34): the silent THP movie of the basement (stage 3), reached
# from a new game. The movie is played by the event of the socket on the big robot of the basement, the first time
# Chibi-Robo plugs into it (story flag not set yet in a new game). tools/run.py --stage basement loads the save into
# stage 3 (game.toml, [stage]): Chibi-Robo starts at the top of the stairs. The route goes down the stairs, across the
# floor (a short cutscene without dialogue on the way), to the socket; A takes the plug in hand, A plugs in, then A
# every 30 frames goes through the dialogue of the event. No A during the movie (about 46 s, 1380 frames at 29.97 fps);
# the event goes on after it.
# Run it with the user folder left by the "new-game" scenario (save in slot 1):
#   py -3 tools/run.py chibi-robo --version GGTE01 --stage basement --user-seed <new-game folder>/user \
#     --scenario games/chibi-robo/scenarios/play/GGTE01/basement-movie.scn
# Checkpoints: every 2 frames at the start of the movie, every frame at its end, every 30 frames in between, 30
# consecutive frames in the middle (each frame of the movie is shown).
# Not run by tools/ab.py (progression scenario). No game data here: buttons, frame numbers and names only.
# Recorded on GGTE01 (cycle clock, RTC 800000000).
name basement-movie
description New-game save loaded into the basement (--stage basement): walk to the socket of the big robot, plug in, the basement THP movie (US).
version GGTE01
after new-game     # preparation: user folder (save) left by "new-game"
window 0
input   450 A       # health and safety warning
input  1600 A       # title screen: Load Game
input  1850 LEFT       # file selection: from file 1 to file 3 (the cursor wraps around)
input  1900 RIGHT       # ... and back to file 1
input  1950 A       # load file 1
input  2150 SLEFT 80       # top of the stairs: down the first steps
input  2230 SDOWN 340       # off the side of the stairs, then across the floor (a cutscene starts on the way)
input  3060 SDOWN+SRIGHT 80       # after the cutscene: towards the wall
input  3150 SUP+SLEFT 60       # along the big robot
input  3215 SUP+SRIGHT 42       # next to the socket
input  3290 A       # take the plug in hand
input  3460 A       # plug into the socket: the event starts
# A every 30 frames from 4130 to 5100: dialogue of the event (each line waits for A)
input  4130 A
input  4160 A
input  4190 A
input  4220 A
input  4250 A
input  4280 A
input  4310 A
input  4340 A
input  4370 A
input  4400 A
input  4430 A
input  4460 A
input  4490 A
input  4520 A
input  4550 A
input  4580 A
input  4610 A
input  4640 A
input  4670 A
input  4700 A
input  4730 A
input  4760 A
input  4790 A
input  4820 A
input  4850 A
input  4880 A
input  4910 A
input  4940 A
input  4970 A
input  5000 A
input  5030 A
input  5060 A
input  5090 A
